# Transcrição

Decisão de provider: `docs/22-transcription-provider-decision.md`. Compatibilidade: `docs/27-transcription-v3-cross-platform.md`.

- Default path is live Groq transcription. The browser captures with MediaRecorder and posts chunks to `/api/session-capture/transcribe-chunk`. Do not run ONNX/Whisper/Transformers.js in the browser.
- Prefer feature detection (MediaRecorder, MIME, IndexedDB, Web Crypto) over user-agent sniffing.
- `GROQ_API_KEY` is server-only via `getGroqTranscriptionEnv()`. Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_GROQ_*`. Never call Groq from a client module.
- Live audio stays in request memory. Do not write live chunks to Supabase Storage. Import may use private temporary storage and must delete after persist.
- The browser obtains a short-lived `session_capture_grant` before activating the microphone. The same consent gate applies to import upload grants.
- Persist final transcript segments incrementally and idempotently by `(session_id, sequence)`. Show text in the UI only after ACK.
- Encrypted IndexedDB spool is the prolonged-failure backup. Never store plaintext audio in localStorage/sessionStorage/cookies. If the CryptoKey cannot be persisted, classify `SECURE_SPOOL_UNAVAILABLE` instead of falling back to plaintext.
- Diarization is optional. Do not synthesize speakers. Do not add emotion recognition. ASR is not a clinical fact.
